{"version":1,"content":"<p>香港經典功夫片傳奇反派、有「腿法宗師」美譽的南韓武打巨星黃正利，於前日（12日）在首爾安詳離世，享年81歲，前世界武術總聯合會議長金鎮勇在社交發文證實噩耗，透露黃正利已於首爾江南聖母醫院安詳離世，家屬預計於本月15日舉行出殯儀式。</p><p>消息傳出後</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T05:20:02.157647+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T04:44:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T05:13:14.451174+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T05:13:14.451174+00:00","content_hash":"52db31b9e783badbe960bb6f355ed894c2c8050084b088c7e9d13464b1dd6443","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}